sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Ember UI
    participant Coordinator as ChatCoordinator
    participant Engine as ConversationEngine
    participant Memory as MemoryStore
    participant Model as On-device model
    participant Inspector as Context + Tokens

    User->>UI: Send a message
    UI->>Coordinator: send(text, conversation)
    Coordinator->>Engine: performTurn(prompt)
    Engine->>Memory: hybrid search over local snapshot
    Memory-->>Engine: ranked notes + conversation snippets
    Engine-->>Inspector: expose visible memory and projected budget
    Engine->>Model: stream augmented prompt
    Model-->>Engine: cumulative response snapshots
    Engine-->>UI: update one growing response bubble
    Engine-->>Inspector: refresh transcript and exact token counts
    Coordinator->>Memory: index user turn + save deduplicated durable facts
    Coordinator-->>UI: persist completed exchange in SwiftData
